---
interface Props { kind?: 'case' | 'results'; }
const { kind = 'case' } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class="evaluation-evidence">
  {kind === 'case' ? <>
    <div class="eyebrow">QUIRL / ONE DISAGREEMENT</div>
    <h3>A red result. A useful answer.</h3>
    <p class="request">“Show recursively how much disk space each subdirectory consumes, not the directory entry size.”</p>
    <div class="comparison" aria-label="Original benchmark result">
      <div><span>Expected label</span><strong class="code">NONE</strong><small>The answer key</small></div>
      <div><span>Model selection</span><strong class="code">tree</strong><small>The recorded response</small></div>
      <div class="verdict"><span>Original verdict</span><strong>Mismatch</strong><small><code>correct: false</code></small></div>
    </div>
    <details>
      <summary>Inspect the catalog <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></summary>
      <div class="catalog">
        <p class="reveal-title">The missing capability was already there.</p>
        <div class="catalog-row"><code>tree --du</code><span>Directory sizes from their contents</span></div>
        <div class="catalog-row"><code>eza --total-size</code><span>Recursive directory-size totals</span></div>
        <p class="correction"><strong>Correction:</strong> accept <code>tree</code> or <code>eza</code> for this case. Keep the original record beside the correction.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    <figcaption>Selected fields from recorded case <code>stress-command-07</code>, arranged for comparison. Opening the catalog shows the documented label correction; it does not rerun the model or either command.</figcaption>
  </> : <>
    <div class="eyebrow">QUIRL / WHAT THE RECORD CONTAINS</div>
    <h3>Leave room for the case you cannot assess.</h3>
    <p class="grid-intro">Each square is one of the <strong>112 distinct cases</strong>.</p>
    <div class="case-grid" role="img" aria-label="112 distinct cases: 111 validated answers acceptable under corrected labels, and one unassessed response. These are synthetic research cases, not a production accuracy estimate.">
      {Array.from({ length: 112 }, (_, i) => <span class:list={['case', { unknown: i === 111 }]} aria-hidden="true">{i === 111 ? '?' : ''}</span>)}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <div><span class="swatch accepted" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>111</strong> acceptable under corrected labels</span></div>
      <div><span class="swatch unknown" aria-hidden="true">?</span><span><strong>1</strong> unassessed validation rejection</span></div>
    </div>
    <figcaption>The challenge set was exploratory, and one expected label was corrected. The missing response stays unassessed. This is a record of a small synthetic experiment, not a real-world accuracy score.</figcaption>
  </>}
</figure>

<style>
  .evaluation-evidence { margin: 2.2rem 0; padding: clamp(1.1rem, 4vw, 2rem); background: #191527; border: 1px solid #57456e; border-radius: 20px; color: #eee9fa; box-shadow: 0 12px 36px #0002; }
  .eyebrow { font: 600 .67rem/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #c2aaff; }
  h3 { margin: .5rem 0 1rem; color: #f1edfa; font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.65rem); line-height: 1.3; }
  .request { margin: 0 0 1.4rem; max-width: 40rem; color: #d5ccdf; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .comparison { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1.15fr; gap: .6rem; }
  .comparison > div { min-width: 0; padding: 1rem .8rem; background: #272036; border: 1px solid #4a3c61; border-radius: 10px; }
  .comparison span, .comparison strong, .comparison small { display: block; }
  .comparison span { color: #c5b8d9; font-size: .72rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .comparison strong { margin: .65rem 0; color: #f1edfa; font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.65rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25; }
  .comparison small { color: #c5b8d9; font-size: .7rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .comparison .verdict { background: #352630; border-color: #79534d; }
  .verdict strong { color: #ffb89a; }
  .code, code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; }
  code { color: #dbcbfa; background: none; padding: 0; font-size: .9em; }
  code::before, code::after { content: none; }
  details { margin-top: 1rem; border: 1px solid #786092; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; padding: .9rem 1rem; color: #e0cfff; background: #322442; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600; }
  summary span { float: right; }
  summary:hover { background: #402d55; }
  summary:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #74e3cc; outline-offset: -4px; border-radius: 9px; }
  .catalog { padding: 1rem; }
  .reveal-title { margin: 0 0 .8rem; color: #ede7f7; font-size: .95rem; }
  .catalog-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10rem 1fr; gap: .7rem; padding: .7rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #493b59; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .catalog-row span { color: #c9bfd6; }
  .correction { margin: .8rem 0 0; border-left: 3px solid #89d5ba; padding-left: .8rem; color: #d1e8df; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .grid-intro { color: #cfc4df; font-size: .9rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .grid-intro strong { color: #eee8f7; }
  .case-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(14, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 5px; max-width: 520px; margin: 1.2rem 0; }
  .case { display: grid; place-items: center; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 4px; background: #b59adf; border: 1px solid #d3bef1; }
  .unknown { background: #342b2b; border: 1px dashed #ffcc80; color: #ffdcaa; font: 700 .85rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; }
  .legend { display: grid; gap: .6rem; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #d5ccdf; }
  .legend > div { display: flex; gap: .6rem; align-items: center; }
  .legend strong { color: #f1edfa; }
  .swatch { flex: 0 0 16px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 3px; display: grid; place-items: center; }
  .accepted { background: #b59adf; border: 1px solid #d3bef1; }
  figcaption { color: #bdb1cd; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.75; margin-top: 1.2rem; text-align: left; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .comparison { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .comparison .verdict { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .comparison .verdict strong { margin: .3rem 0; }
    .catalog-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .2rem; }
    .case-grid { gap: 4px; }
    .case.unknown { font-size: .65rem; }
  }
</style>
